{"delay_ms":0,"frame":{"classification":"C2","ledger_seq":null,"ns":[],"payload":{"kind":"rationale","path":"llm","rendered":"The binding clock for pre-positioning crews at both yards is 26 Sep 22:29Z, with the nominal decision point at 27 Sep 00:00Z (earliest plausible 26 Sep 23:00Z, latest 27 Sep 01:15Z) and a mobilise-and-stage lead time of 300 min. If this slips, the stated consequence is 27 Sep 05:00Z, and crews would not be staged before wind onset. This proposal is tier T3 and waits for command and logistics; it depends on crews being available, both yards lying outside the hazard zone, and the advisory still confirming the storm track.","structured":{"evidence_ids":["E1","E6"],"preconditions":["advisory_confirms_track","crews_available","yard_outside_hazard_zone"],"rationale":"The binding clock for pre-positioning crews at both yards is {E1.effective_decide_by}, with the nominal decision point at {E1.decide_by} (earliest plausible {E1.decide_by_p10}, latest {E1.decide_by_p90}) and a mobilise-and-stage lead time of {E1.lead_time}. If this slips, the stated consequence is {E1.consequence}, and crews would not be staged before wind onset. This proposal is tier {E6.tier} and waits for {E6.approver_functions}; it depends on crews being available, both yards lying outside the hazard zone, and the advisory still confirming the storm track."}},"run_id":"run-bd74a1c88c8f","run_mode":"replay","scenario_time":null,"seq":44,"ts":"2026-11-22T11:53:27.708733Z","type":"artifact","v":1},"id":"run:run-bd74a1c88c8f.1795348405.44"}
